sequenceDiagram
    participant ORDER as Order Service
    participant PAYMENT as Payment Service
    participant PESAPAL as Pesapal Gateway
    participant WALLET as Wallet Service
    participant NOTIFICATION as Notification Service
    participant ANALYTICS as Analytics Service
    participant KAFKA as Kafka Event Bus

    Note over ORDER,ANALYTICS: Payment Processing Saga

    ORDER->>KAFKA: Publish OrderStockReserved event
    
    KAFKA->>PAYMENT: OrderStockReserved event
    activate PAYMENT
    PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Create payment record (PENDING)
    PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Extract payment details
    PAYMENT->>KAFKA: Publish PaymentInitiated event
    deactivate PAYMENT

    Note over PAYMENT,KAFKA: Saga Step 1: Fraud Detection

    KAFKA->>PAYMENT: PaymentInitiated event
    activate PAYMENT
    PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Run fraud detection rules
    PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Check transaction limits
    PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Verify customer history
    alt Fraud Check Passed
        PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Update status (FRAUD_CHECK_PASSED)
        PAYMENT->>KAFKA: Publish FraudCheckPassed event
    else Fraud Detected
        PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Update status (FRAUD_REJECTED)
        PAYMENT->>KAFKA: Publish FraudCheckFailed event
    end
    deactivate PAYMENT

    Note over PAYMENT,KAFKA: Saga Step 2: Payment Processing

    KAFKA->>PAYMENT: FraudCheckPassed event
    activate PAYMENT
    PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Determine payment method
    
    alt Card/Mobile Money Payment
        PAYMENT->>PESAPAL: POST /payment/initiate
        activate PESAPAL
        PESAPAL->>PESAPAL: Process payment
        PESAPAL-->>PAYMENT: Payment response
        deactivate PESAPAL
        
        alt Payment Successful
            PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Update status (COMPLETED)
            PAYMENT->>KAFKA: Publish PaymentCompleted event
        else Payment Failed
            PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Update status (FAILED)
            PAYMENT->>KAFKA: Publish PaymentFailed event
        end
        
    else Wallet Payment
        PAYMENT->>WALLET: Check balance
        activate WALLET
        WALLET-->>PAYMENT: Balance available
        deactivate WALLET
        
        alt Sufficient Balance
            PAYMENT->>WALLET: Deduct amount
            activate WALLET
            WALLET->>WALLET: Update wallet balance
            WALLET-->>PAYMENT: Success
            deactivate WALLET
            PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Update status (COMPLETED)
            PAYMENT->>KAFKA: Publish PaymentCompleted event
        else Insufficient Balance
            PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Update status (FAILED)
            PAYMENT->>KAFKA: Publish PaymentFailed event
        end
        
    else Cash on Delivery
        PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Update status (COD_PENDING)
        PAYMENT->>KAFKA: Publish PaymentCODScheduled event
    end
    deactivate PAYMENT

    Note over PAYMENT,KAFKA: Saga Step 3: Notifications

    KAFKA->>NOTIFICATION: PaymentCompleted event
    activate NOTIFICATION
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send payment receipt email
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send SMS confirmation
    NOTIFICATION->>KAFKA: Publish EmailSent event
    deactivate NOTIFICATION

    KAFKA->>NOTIFICATION: PaymentFailed event
    activate NOTIFICATION
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send payment failure email
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Include retry instructions
    NOTIFICATION->>KAFKA: Publish EmailSent event
    deactivate NOTIFICATION

    Note over PAYMENT,KAFKA: Saga Step 4: Analytics

    KAFKA->>ANALYTICS: PaymentInitiated, PaymentCompleted
    activate ANALYTICS
    ANALYTICS->>ANALYTICS: Track payment metrics
    ANALYTICS->>ANALYTICS: Update revenue dashboards
    ANALYTICS->>ANALYTICS: Detect payment patterns
    deactivate ANALYTICS

    Note over ORDER,ANALYTICS: Compensation Flow - Refund Processing

    ORDER->>KAFKA: Publish OrderCancelled event
    
    KAFKA->>PAYMENT: OrderCancelled event
    activate PAYMENT
    PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Check if payment completed
    alt Payment Completed
        PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Initiate refund
        PAYMENT->>PESAPAL: POST /payment/refund
        activate PESAPAL
        PESAPAL->>PESAPAL: Process refund
        PESAPAL-->>PAYMENT: Refund response
        deactivate PESAPAL
        PAYMENT->>PAYMENT: Update status (REFUNDED)
        PAYMENT->>KAFKA: Publish RefundProcessed event
    end
    deactivate PAYMENT

    KAFKA->>NOTIFICATION: RefundProcessed event
    activate NOTIFICATION
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send refund confirmation
    NOTIFICATION->>KAFKA: Publish EmailSent event
    deactivate NOTIFICATION
